Pre-existing regression candidate found during NEARS-2713 regression sweep
(unrelated to the a11y container:true fix — CartController business logic,
not NIconButton semantics).

Repro: UserApp search-results screen, quick "Remove" quantity-stepper button
on an item card (item_id=553, "Cheeseburger" @ Noodle Bar) -> DELETE
/api/v1/customer/cart/remove-item -> HTTP 400 -> item is NOT removed from
cart (qty stays at 1), on-screen toast reads "Module id required".

Device: emulator-5556, UserApp worktree nears-NEARS-2713-nicon-button-container,
zone1 (Demo Zone - Dhaka), customer@nears.com.

